{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0193","paragraphs":[{"id":"p5b181d3c3f8d-1","text":"门隔花深梦旧游。"},{"id":"pdd6f46b6c5f5-1","text":"夕阳无语燕归愁。"},{"id":"p068a6adeb324-1","text":"玉纤香动小帘钩。"},{"id":"p144f7b997c02-1","text":"落絮无声春堕泪，行云有影月含羞。"},{"id":"pb4353cce5d41-1","text":"东风临夜冷於秋。"}]}